<https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#TransitiveProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ha granularità più fine di"@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a formal unit to a formal unit of coarser textual granularity (e.g., a letter with respect to a syllable or a word), exclusively within the FormalUnitScheme. The property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:Concept."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has finer granularity than"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Collega un'unità formale a un'unità formale di granularità testuale più ampia (es. la lettera rispetto a sillaba e parola), esclusivamente entro il FormalUnitScheme. La proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:Concept."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/desmos/coarserThan> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/desmos/> .
